*.secrets

# NOTE: .npmrc itself is tracked on purpose. It carries pnpm behaviour settings
# (strict-peer-dependencies, link-workspace-packages) and must never hold a
# registry token. Put machine-local overrides in .npmrc.local, which is ignored above.

